<section id="capabilities" class="border-b border-border bg-surface">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-[1120px] px-5 py-16 lg:px-6 lg:py-20" data-reveal>
    <div class="mb-9 max-w-2xl">
      <p class="font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.08em] text-subtle">Product architecture</p>
      <h2 class="mt-3 text-3xl font-semibold tracking-[-0.035em] text-ink">Application tools on the page. Career context in the workspace.</h2>
      <p class="mt-4 max-w-xl text-sm leading-6 text-muted">Each capability stays inside a visible product boundary: local data, explicit fill, deterministic matching, and manual submission.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="grid grid-cols-6 gap-3">
      <article class="col-span-full flex min-h-[260px] flex-col justify-between overflow-hidden rounded-lg border border-border bg-background p-5 sm:col-span-3 lg:col-span-2">
        <div class="flex items-center justify-between font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.08em] text-subtle">
          <span>Submission boundary</span>
          <span>01</span>
        </div>
        <div class="relative mx-auto my-8 flex h-28 w-56 items-center justify-center" aria-hidden="true">
          <svg class="absolute inset-0 size-full text-border-strong" viewBox="0 0 224 112" fill="none">
            <ellipse cx="112" cy="56" rx="104" ry="45" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1" />
            <ellipse cx="112" cy="56" rx="82" ry="33" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1" stroke-dasharray="3 5" />
          </svg>
          <div class="text-center">
            <strong class="font-mono text-5xl font-semibold tracking-[-0.06em] text-ink">0</strong>
            <p class="mt-1 text-xs text-subtle">auto-submit actions</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div>
          <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold tracking-[-0.025em] text-ink">You keep the final action.</h3>
          <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-6 text-muted">Jobflow can prepare and fill ready fields, but Apply, Submit, Next, and navigation remain on the employer site.</p>
        </div>
      </article>

      <article class="col-span-full flex min-h-[260px] flex-col justify-between overflow-hidden rounded-lg border border-border bg-background p-5 sm:col-span-3 lg:col-span-2">
        <div class="flex items-center justify-between font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.08em] text-subtle">
          <span>Storage boundary</span>
          <span>02</span>
        </div>
        <div class="mx-auto my-7 grid size-32 place-items-center rounded-full border border-border-strong" aria-hidden="true">
          <div class="grid size-24 place-items-center rounded-full border border-border">
            <svg class="size-10 text-ink" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.25" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
              <rect x="5" y="10" width="14" height="10" rx="2" />
              <path d="M8 10V7a4 4 0 0 1 8 0v3" />
              <path d="M12 14v2" />
            </svg>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div>
          <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold tracking-[-0.025em] text-ink">Local by default.</h3>
          <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-6 text-muted">Career data stays in extension storage and IndexedDB. Sensitive values live in an encrypted local vault.</p>
        </div>
      </article>

      <article class="col-span-full flex min-h-[260px] flex-col justify-between overflow-hidden rounded-lg border border-border bg-background p-5 sm:col-span-3 lg:col-span-2">
        <div class="flex items-center justify-between font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.08em] text-subtle">
          <span>Matching model</span>
          <span>03</span>
        </div>
        <div class="my-7 border-y border-border font-mono text-xs" aria-hidden="true">
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between py-3"><span class="text-muted">Canonical field</span><span class="text-success">READY</span></div>
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between border-t border-border py-3"><span class="text-muted">Ambiguous mapping</span><span class="text-warning">REVIEW</span></div>
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between border-t border-border py-3"><span class="text-muted">Sensitive value</span><span class="text-subtle">SEPARATE</span></div>
        </div>
        <div>
          <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold tracking-[-0.025em] text-ink">Deterministic core.</h3>
          <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-6 text-muted">Known mappings are prepared automatically. Ambiguity and sensitive disclosure remain explicit states instead of hidden guesses.</p>
        </div>
      </article>

      <article class="col-span-full overflow-hidden rounded-lg border border-border bg-background lg:col-span-3">
        <div class="grid h-full min-h-[300px] sm:grid-cols-[0.88fr_1.12fr]">
          <div class="flex flex-col justify-between border-b border-border p-5 sm:border-b-0 sm:border-r">
            <div class="flex items-center justify-between font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.08em] text-subtle">
              <span>On the application page</span>
              <span>04</span>
            </div>
            <div class="mt-10">
              <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold tracking-[-0.025em] text-ink">One assistant, three tools.</h3>
              <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-6 text-muted">Autofill handles ready fields, Pipeline keeps the opportunity, and Sensitive isolates protected disclosure.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="relative m-4 overflow-hidden rounded-md border border-border bg-surface sm:ml-0" aria-hidden="true">
            <div class="flex items-start justify-between border-b border-border px-4 py-3">
              <div>
                <p class="font-mono text-[9px] uppercase tracking-[0.08em] text-subtle">Job Flow</p>
                <p class="mt-1 text-xs font-semibold text-ink">Application assistant</p>
              </div>
              <span class="font-mono text-[10px] text-subtle">×</span>
            </div>
            <div class="grid grid-cols-3 border-b border-border text-center text-[11px]">
              <span class="border-r border-border bg-surface-muted px-2 py-2 text-ink">Autofill</span>
              <span class="border-r border-border px-2 py-2 text-muted">Pipeline</span>
              <span class="px-2 py-2 text-muted">Sensitive</span>
            </div>
            <div class="p-4">
              <div class="flex items-end justify-between border-b border-border pb-3">
                <div><strong class="text-sm text-ink">14 ready</strong><p class="mt-1 text-[10px] text-subtle">3 review · 1 sensitive</p></div>
                <span class="font-mono text-[10px] text-success">LOCAL</span>
              </div>
              <div class="mt-3 space-y-2">
                <div class="flex items-center justify-between text-xs"><span class="text-muted">First name</span><span class="font-mono text-[9px] text-success">ready</span></div>
                <div class="flex items-center justify-between text-xs"><span class="text-muted">Current role</span><span class="font-mono text-[9px] text-warning">review</span></div>
                <div class="flex items-center justify-between text-xs"><span class="text-muted">Visa sponsorship</span><span class="font-mono text-[9px] text-subtle">sensitive</span></div>
              </div>
              <div class="mt-4 flex h-9 items-center justify-center rounded-md bg-accent text-xs font-medium text-background">Fill 14 ready fields</div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </article>

      <article class="col-span-full overflow-hidden rounded-lg border border-border bg-background lg:col-span-3">
        <div class="grid h-full min-h-[300px] sm:grid-cols-[0.9fr_1.1fr]">
          <div class="flex flex-col justify-between border-b border-border p-5 sm:border-b-0 sm:border-r">
            <div class="flex items-center justify-between font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.08em] text-subtle">
              <span>In the workspace</span>
              <span>05</span>
            </div>
            <div class="mt-10">
              <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold tracking-[-0.025em] text-ink">One reusable career context.</h3>
              <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-6 text-muted">Career Profile, Application Profiles, Documents, and Autofill Memory stay inspectable before they are used on a form.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="relative min-h-[260px] p-5" aria-hidden="true">
            <div class="absolute left-1/2 top-5 bottom-5 w-px -translate-x-1/2 bg-border"></div>
            <div class="relative flex h-full flex-col justify-center gap-5">
              <div class="flex items-center justify-end gap-2 pr-[calc(50%-14px)]">
                <span class="rounded-md border border-border bg-surface px-2.5 py-1.5 text-[11px] text-ink">Documents</span>
                <span class="grid size-7 place-items-center rounded-full border border-border-strong bg-background font-mono text-[9px] text-subtle">D</span>
              </div>
              <div class="flex items-center gap-2 pl-[calc(50%-14px)]">
                <span class="grid size-7 place-items-center rounded-full border border-border-strong bg-background font-mono text-[9px] text-subtle">P</span>
                <span class="rounded-md border border-border bg-surface px-2.5 py-1.5 text-[11px] text-ink">Career Profile</span>
              </div>
              <div class="flex items-center justify-end gap-2 pr-[calc(50%-14px)]">
                <span class="rounded-md border border-border bg-surface px-2.5 py-1.5 text-[11px] text-ink">Application Profiles</span>
                <span class="grid size-7 place-items-center rounded-full border border-border-strong bg-background font-mono text-[9px] text-subtle">A</span>
              </div>
              <div class="flex items-center gap-2 pl-[calc(50%-14px)]">
                <span class="grid size-7 place-items-center rounded-full border border-border-strong bg-background font-mono text-[9px] text-subtle">M</span>
                <span class="rounded-md border border-border bg-surface px-2.5 py-1.5 text-[11px] text-ink">Autofill Memory</span>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </article>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
